{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04383","headline":"感遇诗三十八首 九 · 陈子昂","name":"感遇诗三十八首 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣人秘元命，惧世乱其真。\n如何嵩公辈，诙谲误时人。\n先天诚爲美，阶乱祸谁因。\n长城备胡寇，嬴祸发其亲。\n赤精既迷汉，子年何救秦。\n去去桃李花，多言死如麻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈子昂","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04383.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04383","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}